.TH AXFR-GET 1 "2026-07-23" "rgbdns 0.1.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
axfr-get \- retrieve a DNS zone using AXFR
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B axfr-get
.I zone server[:port] output temporary
.SH DESCRIPTION
Requests an AXFR transfer of
.I zone
from the numeric server address and writes the result in tinydns data format.
Port 53 is used when no port is given.  The temporary file is used while
constructing the output so an incomplete transfer does not replace it.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR axfrdns (1),
.BR tinydns-data (1)
